Fire out a spear of cosmic energies. If it hits an enemy it deals [209, 281, 337, 384, 426 (TL1-5; SP 100)] damage, otherwise it explodes in a thin cone of radius 4 at the end of its range, blocked by enemies, which deals [83, 112, 135, 154, 171 (TL1-5; SP 100)] to [209, 281, 337, 384, 426 (TL1-5; SP 100)] damage depending on how much the enemies block.
